<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" article-type="correction"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">J Gen Physiol</journal-id><journal-id journal-id-type="publisher-id">jgp</journal-id><journal-title>The Journal of General Physiology</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0022-1295</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1540-7748</issn><publisher><publisher-name>The Rockefeller University Press</publisher-name></publisher></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2248722</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="publisher-id">20070995302052008c</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1085/jgp.20070995302052008c</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Correction</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>To ATP or Not To ATP: This Is the Question</article-title></title-group><contrib-group><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Accardi</surname><given-names>Alessio</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><month>3</month><year>2008</year></pub-date><volume>131</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>284</fpage><lpage>284</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 2008, The Rockefeller University Press</copyright-statement></permissions><self-uri xlink:title="pdf" xlink:href="jgp1310284.pdf"/></article-meta></front><body><p>Volume 131, No. 2, February 4, 2008. Pages <related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="131" page="105" id="N0x461db90N0x4874e10" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="18227270" ext-link-type="pubmed">105&#x02013;108</related-article>.</p><p>The original version of this commentary contained citation errors. Citations of Bennetts et al., 2001, should have been Bennetts et al., 2007, with the exception of page 106, right column, line 30. The full Bennetts et al., 2007, reference, originally missing from the reference list, is:</p><p>Bennetts, B., M.W. Parker, and B.A. Cromer. 2007. Inhibition of skeletal muscle ClC-1 chloride channels by low intracellular pH and ATP. <italic>J. Biol. Chem</italic>. 282:32780&#x02013;32791.</p><p>The online versions have been corrected.</p></body></article>